{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_oldm_01_01",
      "hash": "7b5f30ecc4e4e575",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝天謝地！謝天謝地啊！\\c\\n想不到我竟然可以一睹\\n龍神大人的遺骨！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_02_01",
      "hash": "e7c8eb752043ec2a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡展示了好幾種\\n舉世罕見的古代寶可夢化石！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_tenji_01_01",
      "hash": "ae23c51d9d7cb43d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有一塊非常通透漂亮的\\n金黃色琥珀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_tenji_02_01",
      "hash": "00318501e22c384a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "稀有的古代寶可夢\\n化石翼龍的化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_tenji_03_01",
      "hash": "ad07b10bf306afbf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "稀有的古代寶可夢\\n鐮刀盔的化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_tenji_04_01",
      "hash": "dcf9c135aace2924",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇！是古代的寶可夢！\\n……不對，原來是模型！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_tenji_05_01",
      "hash": "0a472d3c0d4da7f9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在月見山發現的\\n各種化石"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_studym1_03_p01_t003_r0101",
      "hash": "4d50ef9853eab16b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_studym1_03_p02_t003_r0101",
      "hash": "fc91e03b1b8f19cc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_studym1_03_p03_t003_r0101",
      "hash": "dad19c409aeea299",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_studym1_03_p04_t003_r0101",
      "hash": "dfa5511cde6f5202",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_03_01",
      "hash": "3e2e977cbbad799f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "宇宙的秘密……\\n地球的秘密……\\c\\n雖然有太多的未解之謎，\\n但是絕對不能放棄研究！"
    }
  ],
